From 82f0ae32131ee5d9d5e256a4bdce4ddee05156d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: well0nez <well0nez@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:46:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/40] sunxi: h713: name this board's defconfigs after the
 product

The board is sold as an HY310. Its silkscreen reads HY260_QZ713_V3.1 and
its label CGDD00700507/HY260A, which is where the previous names came
from, and both are recorded in the commit that added them.

Everything else about this projector -- its vendor dumps, its device
tree, the reverse-engineering notes it came out of -- calls it an HY310,
and so does the panel description in the patches that follow. Rather than
carry two names for one board through a display series, use the one a
reader can look up.

No content change; the two files are identical.
---
 configs/{hy260_host_defconfig => hy310_host_defconfig}            | 0
 .../{hy260_qz713_v3_1_defconfig => hy310_qz713_v3_1_defconfig}    | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename configs/{hy260_host_defconfig => hy310_host_defconfig} (100%)
 rename configs/{hy260_qz713_v3_1_defconfig => hy310_qz713_v3_1_defconfig} (100%)

diff --git a/configs/hy260_host_defconfig b/configs/hy310_host_defconfig
similarity index 100%
rename from configs/hy260_host_defconfig
rename to configs/hy310_host_defconfig
diff --git a/configs/hy260_qz713_v3_1_defconfig b/configs/hy310_qz713_v3_1_defconfig
similarity index 100%
rename from configs/hy260_qz713_v3_1_defconfig
rename to configs/hy310_qz713_v3_1_defconfig
